      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Deckard tends to do well on Maps that feature many choke points, where he is able to get value from Scroll Of Sealing and his Heroic Ability: Stay Awhile and Listen or Lorenado. Battlegrounds with a lot of wide areas (such as Hanamura Temple) will obviously make this characteristic harder to exploit.\n\nThe way Healing Potion works is particularly good when contesting powerful Objectives that take a long time to be secured (for example Shrines on Infernal Shrines). Having to move too much on the battlefield means you will get less value out of the potion-stocking aspect."
  },
