      "name": "Sapphire Emerald Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Deckard's Sapphire Emerald Build increases your burst healing as well as your crowd control and utility. Due to its nature, this Build excels in short team fights.\n\nSapphire at Level 1 can be used to engage for your team and/or as a setup Scroll Of Sealing. Emerald at Level 7 should be used on the kill target, so that the Healer will not be able to save them.\n\nThanks to the Shield it provides, Potion of Shielding at Level 4 helps you keep alive whoever is being focused by enemy Heroes. Horadric Staff at Level 16 can be used to peel for allied Heroes and/or counter-engage.",
