    {
      "name": "Ruby Emerald Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "Deckard's Ruby Emerald Build increases your sustain healing and utility at the cost of crowd control. Due to its nature, this Build excels in long team fights.\n\nRuby at Level 4 is best used on multiple enemy Heroes when they are surrounding allied Heroes, to spawn more Lesser Healing Potions near your teammates. Emerald at Level 7 should be used on the kill target, so that the Healer will not be able to save them.\n\nField Study at Level 1 increases your Spell Power, which not only increases your damage done with Abilities but also your healing done. Safety in Numbers at Level 16 further increases the value you get from your Basic Abilities by reducing their cooldown.",
